WEBVTT

01:41.520 --> 01:43.720
TINGYUN PAVILION

02:17.640 --> 02:18.920
Beauty?

02:26.040 --> 02:27.200
Third Brother.

02:30.480 --> 02:31.680
Oh, my big brother.

02:36.800 --> 02:38.520
Your hands are so soft.

02:44.480 --> 02:47.640
You never cease to be mischievous.

03:07.800 --> 03:09.320
Your Highness, please have some tea.

03:11.880 --> 03:14.120
My lord. Sober-up tea.

03:24.640 --> 03:25.680
Lianxiu?

03:27.440 --> 03:29.520
Were you the one who waited on Mother
back in the day, eh?

03:30.280 --> 03:31.920
Your Highness, indeed,
you never forget a thing.

03:32.440 --> 03:34.680
These years,
my brother has been well cared for.

03:34.760 --> 03:35.880
Thank you.

03:35.960 --> 03:36.880
It's my job, Your Highness.

03:37.480 --> 03:38.520
You can go now.

03:48.160 --> 03:50.280
When we were young,
we secretly drank wine.

03:51.200 --> 03:53.440
Mother punished us
to kneel in the prayer hall.

03:53.520 --> 03:56.000
It was Lianxiu who brewed tea
for us to sober up.

03:59.160 --> 04:02.920
It was me who was wild and unruly,

04:03.000 --> 04:04.600
often angering Mother.

04:05.760 --> 04:09.600
In the end, it was also I
who caused Mother's death.

04:11.240 --> 04:14.520
Luckily, you were there to company her

04:15.040 --> 04:16.519
until her death.

04:18.040 --> 04:19.440
We grew up together.

04:19.519 --> 04:21.760
Mother treated me as her own son.

04:21.839 --> 04:24.000
I was just fulfilling my duty.

04:26.160 --> 04:27.200
Third Brother,

04:27.760 --> 04:29.000
this medicine formula,

04:29.080 --> 04:31.360
I acquired it from a famed healer.

04:31.880 --> 04:33.920
It is best for mending broken bones.

04:34.000 --> 04:36.200
The medicine is prepared. Try it.

04:40.400 --> 04:41.400
This leg of mine…

04:44.720 --> 04:45.560
is a curse.

04:48.600 --> 04:49.560
I won't treat it.

04:50.640 --> 04:51.920
How about this?

04:52.000 --> 04:52.920
After the alliance banquet,

04:53.000 --> 04:56.040
I'll ask Father to grant you
a warmer residence.

04:56.120 --> 04:57.440
The cold of Jingbei

04:57.520 --> 04:58.920
isn't good for your leg.

04:59.000 --> 05:01.840
If you truly wish to help me,

05:03.840 --> 05:05.720
then let me stay in Zhaojing.

05:08.200 --> 05:10.040
Zhaojing's lands are nurturing,

05:10.880 --> 05:14.720
and if free,

05:14.800 --> 05:16.240
you could come visit me.

05:21.560 --> 05:22.600
That would be great.

05:42.120 --> 05:43.280
The Rising Sun Bow?

05:44.760 --> 05:46.080
Everything here hasn't changed.

05:46.680 --> 05:48.160
The Rising Sun Bow is still here.

05:52.040 --> 05:53.320
In the 10th year of the Zhaoming era,

05:53.400 --> 05:54.720
the Lushan Hunt,

05:54.800 --> 05:57.000
I was lost by a horse,

05:57.080 --> 05:59.280
yet the precious fell to you.

06:00.560 --> 06:03.600
You were just being generous.

06:09.000 --> 06:10.880
Actually, in both word and might,

06:11.640 --> 06:13.200
we are equal.

06:14.200 --> 06:16.520
Why do you always let me win?

06:18.120 --> 06:19.080
Nonsense.

06:20.880 --> 06:23.360
You are now the Crown Prince.

06:23.440 --> 06:26.680
From now on, you don't have to do so.

06:37.400 --> 06:40.080
It's kind of patronizing
to keep treating me with kid gloves

06:40.600 --> 06:42.800
just because I'm not as able-bodied.

06:44.240 --> 06:45.360
At the alliance banquet,

06:45.440 --> 06:46.480
I will let you win again.

06:48.080 --> 06:50.200
I heard you've taken a liking
to a Xiyan beauty.

06:50.280 --> 06:51.360
Who is she?

06:51.880 --> 06:54.160
I wouldn't want to take
what's dear to you.

06:54.840 --> 06:55.960
Big Brother,

06:56.480 --> 06:58.600
that woman wants to harm me.

06:58.680 --> 07:00.880
If you want her, take her.

07:00.960 --> 07:03.520
Better if you kill her.

07:03.600 --> 07:04.720
Kill her?

07:05.240 --> 07:06.880
She wants to harm you? What happened?

07:09.840 --> 07:11.120
That beauty

07:12.000 --> 07:14.400
gave me lovesickness.

07:15.200 --> 07:17.000
Yet she won't yield to me.

07:17.080 --> 07:18.800
What say you? Should she be killed?

07:22.600 --> 07:24.840
Other matters, I'll shoulder for you,

07:24.920 --> 07:26.160
but while you may jest and joke,

07:26.240 --> 07:28.200
you must not jeopardize the nation.

07:28.720 --> 07:30.480
This event is of great importance.

07:30.560 --> 07:32.120
Father values it deeply.

07:32.960 --> 07:34.240
Alright.

07:35.280 --> 07:38.240
Father just scolded me, now it's you.

07:38.880 --> 07:41.080
Best not to stay in Zhaojing, then.

07:41.640 --> 07:42.960
Annoying.

07:45.440 --> 07:46.760
Fine. I'll stop.

07:48.120 --> 07:48.960
Rest well.

07:49.040 --> 07:50.120
Take care, Big Brother.

08:38.600 --> 08:41.559
IN MEMORY OF YANG DONGHU, DEPUTY GENERAL
OF GREAT YAN'S WEIBEI ARMY

08:47.960 --> 08:49.640
It is them. I know it.

08:50.400 --> 08:52.360
It is them.

08:52.440 --> 08:54.680
I saw it myself.
They're the ones who set the fire.

08:54.760 --> 08:56.360
They deserve to die.

08:56.440 --> 08:58.920
Kill them.

08:59.000 --> 09:00.200
I swear on my life,

09:00.280 --> 09:01.920
not a single Weibei Army soldier
would dare set fire.

09:02.000 --> 09:03.240
Let's put out the fire first, everyone.

09:03.320 --> 09:05.000
Kill them. Don't let him get away!

09:05.080 --> 09:06.080
The Weibei Army didn't set the fire.

09:06.160 --> 09:07.440
I saw it with my own eyes.

09:07.520 --> 09:08.680
Extinguish the flames first.

09:08.760 --> 09:10.480
- Extinguish the flames first.
- Everyone, stay calm.

09:10.560 --> 09:12.600
- Stay calm.
- Stay calm, everyone.

09:15.840 --> 09:17.760
Hold. Do not point blades at the people.

09:20.640 --> 09:21.800
Yang.

09:29.680 --> 09:31.640
Yang.

09:31.720 --> 09:32.560
- My lord.
- Let me go.

09:32.640 --> 09:33.560
- My lord, it's dangerous.
- Let go of me.

09:33.640 --> 09:34.600
Yang.

09:34.680 --> 09:35.800
- Go.
- Yang!

09:59.880 --> 10:03.360
IN MEMORY OF YANG DONGHU, DEPUTY GENERAL
OF GREAT YAN'S WEIBEI ARMY

10:03.440 --> 10:05.200
IN MEMORY OF WU HE
OFFICER OF GREAT YAN'S WEIBEI ARMY

10:05.280 --> 10:06.920
IN MEMORY OF HUANG QING
GUARD OF GREAT YAN'S WEIBEI ARMY

10:07.000 --> 10:08.440
IN MEMORY OF ZHANG FUTIAN
OFFICER OF GREAT YAN'S WEIBEI ARMY

10:09.920 --> 10:14.480
They knew we Weibei Army was disciplined
and never harmed the people.

10:15.400 --> 10:18.520
So, they incited the Qingzhou people
to besiege the camp.

10:20.320 --> 10:21.200
This time,

10:22.720 --> 10:24.640
I won't be merciful.

10:29.640 --> 10:32.840
The Weibei Army is a righteous army.

10:34.120 --> 10:35.080
Great Yan

10:36.120 --> 10:38.600
will seek justice for you.

10:49.600 --> 10:53.920
Tomorrow's alliance banquet
is your last chance.

10:56.720 --> 11:00.320
What happened during the Qingzhou Fire?

11:26.680 --> 11:29.200
Boring. You weren't scared at all?

11:30.640 --> 11:32.200
Why are you here?

11:32.960 --> 11:34.160
There's something to decide.

11:34.760 --> 11:35.920
To do or not to do,

11:37.560 --> 11:38.880
I am unsure what to choose.

11:41.680 --> 11:43.840
I, too, struggle with choices.

11:44.360 --> 11:46.960
Since I was a child,

11:47.040 --> 11:48.160
my father always chose for me.

11:49.440 --> 11:50.840
But no worries. Wait here for me.

12:00.040 --> 12:03.480
If there's no choice, then let us pray.

12:06.560 --> 12:09.520
Hope the Emperor of Great Yan

12:09.600 --> 12:11.560
is kind and does not scold or beat.

12:12.200 --> 12:13.680
Best if he's kind like my brother.

12:18.320 --> 12:19.560
Forget it.

12:19.640 --> 12:22.920
There will never be another like him.

12:23.920 --> 12:25.480
As long as the Emperor doesn't kill people

12:25.560 --> 12:27.080
like that disabled man, I'm fine.

12:32.800 --> 12:34.120
Look at that. A real blessing.

12:36.000 --> 12:37.360
Is this real?

12:41.240 --> 12:42.760
You've never played this?

12:47.120 --> 12:48.320
Wonderful.

12:48.400 --> 12:49.880
First wishes work best.

12:49.960 --> 12:50.800
Give it a try.

12:51.600 --> 12:52.920
Your Highness.

12:53.840 --> 12:55.120
Your Highness,

12:55.200 --> 12:56.640
His Highness is returning.

12:56.720 --> 12:57.800
I got it.

12:57.880 --> 12:59.680
Go ahead and try.

13:05.200 --> 13:06.600
I know what to do now.

13:30.680 --> 13:34.760
Father, Mother, please bless me.

13:44.400 --> 13:47.040
CHANGXI PAVILION

13:56.160 --> 13:57.280
Mr. Yue Qin.

13:58.840 --> 14:02.040
YUE QIN, XIYAN PRINCE

14:03.600 --> 14:05.720
Zigu detests confinement.

14:05.800 --> 14:08.160
Get a maid familiar with Yan etiquette

14:08.240 --> 14:09.320
to guide her in the palace.

14:11.080 --> 14:13.560
Oh, have you changed the incense?

14:13.640 --> 14:15.040
Zigu sleeps best with familiar scents.

14:15.120 --> 14:17.720
If there's a familiar scent,
maybe she can sleep better.

14:17.800 --> 14:19.680
You may rest assured.

14:19.760 --> 14:21.560
I prepared her incense yesterday,

14:21.640 --> 14:25.080
and by the way,
arranged everything to her liking.

14:40.680 --> 14:41.840
Mei Lin.

14:49.400 --> 14:51.040
Wait for me, Your Highness.

15:03.920 --> 15:05.000
It's a Qingzhou knot,

15:05.720 --> 15:07.160
a charm from Qingzhou folk.

15:20.000 --> 15:22.600
Mei Lin, is that you?

15:22.680 --> 15:25.040
Your Highness, was it really her?

15:25.560 --> 15:27.040
The beauties

15:27.120 --> 15:30.040
include Xiyan exiles from Qingzhou.

15:30.120 --> 15:32.720
Others know the Qingzhou knot, too.

15:34.480 --> 15:35.800
Your Highness.

15:36.480 --> 15:37.520
It's time to go.

15:37.600 --> 15:39.200
Her Highness awaits.

15:46.360 --> 15:48.160
Brother's craftsmanship is unmatched.

15:48.240 --> 15:50.040
His Highness must've put in much effort.

16:00.880 --> 16:01.920
Zigu.

16:06.560 --> 16:07.600
Brother.

16:12.280 --> 16:13.320
Brother.

16:18.560 --> 16:20.880
Brother. I missed you so much.

16:21.400 --> 16:22.600
Brother, look.

16:22.680 --> 16:23.640
I'm all grown up now.

16:23.720 --> 16:25.720
No longer the tearful little fairy.

16:26.720 --> 16:27.920
But I still think

16:28.000 --> 16:30.440
that's the you I find most adorable.

16:34.800 --> 16:38.200
Brother, they say after
the alliance banquet,

16:38.800 --> 16:40.000
you'll return to Xiyan.

16:40.600 --> 16:42.040
I won't go anywhere

16:42.120 --> 16:44.800
until you're settled
and everything is done.

16:44.880 --> 16:46.640
What if I never settle?

16:49.560 --> 16:51.320
I can't protect you forever.

16:58.000 --> 16:59.600
Does the Emperor of Great Yan

16:59.680 --> 17:01.120
kill people at his will?

17:01.640 --> 17:04.359
No, he's a wise ruler.

17:04.440 --> 17:05.760
No need to worry.

17:06.359 --> 17:07.880
Is he handsome?

17:12.800 --> 17:13.839
Forget it.

17:15.280 --> 17:17.359
Handsome or not, he's still an old man.

17:31.400 --> 17:32.440
Brother,

17:32.520 --> 17:33.640
do you have a girl you like?

17:34.600 --> 17:36.280
What about you, Zigu?

17:39.760 --> 17:41.520
Ziyu used to mock me,

17:43.280 --> 17:45.520
saying no one dares to take this.

17:46.800 --> 17:48.520
Now, it seems, she is true.

17:49.200 --> 17:52.040
I wouldn't even know what it feels like
to have a special someone.

17:58.320 --> 17:59.440
What you think of each day.

18:00.560 --> 18:01.720
What you dream of each night.

18:03.960 --> 18:07.080
Brother, do you have someone
in your heart?

18:07.680 --> 18:09.800
Tell me. Who is she?

18:09.880 --> 18:12.680
I fear that in this life,
I will be fated to miss her.

18:14.120 --> 18:17.120
Zigu, tomorrow,
after the alliance banquet,

18:17.200 --> 18:18.360
you will be Concubine Yan of Yan Dynasty.

18:19.320 --> 18:20.600
The jade ring not being given away

18:20.680 --> 18:22.640
is both a regret and a blessing.

18:22.720 --> 18:23.880
The palace rules are complex.

18:23.960 --> 18:25.240
One wrong step--

18:25.320 --> 18:26.800
And it may bring harm to Xiyan.

18:31.040 --> 18:32.160
I know.

18:37.560 --> 18:39.400
No, it would harm you.

18:43.240 --> 18:44.760
Xiyan needs a princess's marriage

18:44.840 --> 18:46.520
to secure peace with Yan Dynasty,

18:47.720 --> 18:49.520
but you owe Xiyan nothing.

18:54.240 --> 18:55.480
Wait for me.

19:13.920 --> 19:16.400
Is this not the dagger
Mother gave to you, Brother?

19:17.520 --> 19:19.960
Now, it is yours.

19:20.040 --> 19:23.200
If, one day, you face a dilemma,

19:23.280 --> 19:26.400
I hope you can prioritize
protecting yourself.

19:30.800 --> 19:32.360
Mother doesn't wish for me
to wield weapons.

19:34.440 --> 19:36.320
You've grown up, Zigu,

19:36.400 --> 19:38.320
and should learn how to use a blade.

19:57.720 --> 20:00.320
IMPERIAL PALACE

20:55.880 --> 20:58.840
Princess Zigu of Xiyan
greets Your Majesty of Great Yan.

20:58.920 --> 21:02.560
May Your Majesty be blessed
with health and a long reign.

21:08.520 --> 21:09.720
Proceed.

21:09.800 --> 21:14.160
To Princess Zigu of Xiyan,

21:14.240 --> 21:17.840
regal and demure, gentle and graceful,

21:17.920 --> 21:21.400
wise and reserved, virtuous in conduct,

21:21.480 --> 21:23.360
and fit for the inner palace.

21:23.440 --> 21:25.720
Thus,

21:25.800 --> 21:28.760
appointed as Concubine Yan,

21:28.840 --> 21:31.160
granting residence in Fanghua Palace.

21:31.240 --> 21:32.680
Execute as decreed.

21:33.280 --> 21:35.040
The proclamation is now complete.

21:36.840 --> 21:42.320
Now, Great Yan and Xiyan
forge ties of harmony.

21:42.400 --> 21:45.680
Let the people of both lands
live as one family

21:45.760 --> 21:49.520
in eternal peace and joy.

21:57.560 --> 21:59.440
Long live Your Majesty's wisdom.

21:59.520 --> 22:05.320
TAICHI PALACE

22:10.920 --> 22:14.240
Twenty chests of lacquered potteries.

22:14.320 --> 22:18.320
Six new gilt sapphire loongs.

22:18.840 --> 22:22.400
Ten pairs of agate cups
in the shape of animal heads.

22:23.440 --> 22:26.040
Ten jars of fermented mare's milk.

22:27.000 --> 22:30.200
Ten jars of Yangpuli wine.

22:31.360 --> 22:34.760
Ten hu of East Sea pearls.

22:36.000 --> 22:39.480
Two Liuli phoenix-tail fans.

22:40.520 --> 22:43.480
Twenty Ferghana horses.

22:44.320 --> 22:48.880
Two bottles of Toxin-Neutralizing
Red Coix Seed Potion.

22:52.240 --> 22:56.880
The 18 Tribes of Xiyan congratulate
Concubine Yan on her marriage.

22:58.400 --> 23:00.360
Concubine Yan, you've come from afar.

23:00.440 --> 23:04.240
I've had imperial cooks specially prepare
Xiyan's bamboo brew

23:05.240 --> 23:08.120
to ease your homesickness.

23:10.520 --> 23:11.480
Well…

23:13.120 --> 23:14.240
Your Majesty…

23:15.480 --> 23:16.960
Concubine Yan, no need for formalities.

23:19.240 --> 23:20.520
Thank you, Your Majesty.

23:20.600 --> 23:22.320
Today is a day of joy.

23:22.400 --> 23:24.280
All in the palace may feast.

23:24.360 --> 23:25.880
There's no need for restraint.

24:35.680 --> 24:38.640
Let the first group of beauties line up.

25:05.520 --> 25:08.640
The beauties of Xiyan
are all remarkably graceful.

25:08.720 --> 25:12.720
Marrying Xiyan beauties
to Yan Dynasty officials

25:12.800 --> 25:14.920
also serves the peace between our nations.

25:15.760 --> 25:17.720
Since the Eastern Palace
leads the noble clans,

25:17.800 --> 25:19.640
Crown Prince shall make the first choice.

25:31.640 --> 25:32.640
Thank you, Father.

26:00.360 --> 26:01.240
What is your name?

26:13.160 --> 26:15.840
Your Highness, my name is Mei Lin.

26:23.480 --> 26:25.760
Judging by your features,
you look like one of our own.

26:28.320 --> 26:32.600
I was born on the Xiyan-Great Yan border

26:33.440 --> 26:35.200
and have lived within Great Yan territory.

26:35.880 --> 26:37.000
Welcome to the Eastern Palace.

26:38.400 --> 26:39.600
Here, take this jade pendant.

27:04.040 --> 27:05.240
Wait.

27:42.080 --> 27:43.200
Third Brother, you…

28:01.600 --> 28:05.040
Son, your leg…

28:05.800 --> 28:07.000
My leg is healed.

28:08.240 --> 28:10.760
Father, I was so focused on the beauty,

28:10.840 --> 28:12.160
I feared Big Brother would pick her first.

28:12.240 --> 28:14.760
In my haste,
I actually stood up on my own.

28:25.840 --> 28:28.160
That's good news.

28:29.320 --> 28:31.920
But you should still have
Imperial Healer Zhang examine it.

28:32.520 --> 28:34.120
Yes, Father.

28:56.480 --> 28:57.920
You aren't the true culprit
of the massacre.

28:58.520 --> 28:59.560
I have proof.

29:02.160 --> 29:03.240
Save me.

29:13.960 --> 29:15.680
- Son!
- Your Majesty!

29:34.880 --> 29:36.480
Your Majesty, rest assured.

29:36.560 --> 29:38.480
Thankfully, Prince Jing
wore a Gold Silk Armor.

29:38.560 --> 29:40.960
It was truly a divine intervention
that saved his life.

29:46.640 --> 29:47.720
Easy there.

29:52.320 --> 29:55.440
Father, I am fine.

29:56.000 --> 29:57.640
Just a few scrapes.

29:58.280 --> 30:01.200
But I was shaken.

30:03.360 --> 30:06.360
Third Brother, you can walk,
yet you've used a wheelchair.

30:07.120 --> 30:08.880
This can be a crime against the throne.

30:11.760 --> 30:13.480
Father, Big Brother,

30:14.720 --> 30:16.880
I had no choice.

30:17.520 --> 30:19.440
Even as a disabled man,
I attract assassins.

30:19.520 --> 30:21.520
Were I to stand up fully,

30:21.600 --> 30:24.120
I doubt If I'd live longer.

30:25.280 --> 30:26.760
Fortunately, I was prepared,

30:26.840 --> 30:28.520
and that saved me this time.

30:28.600 --> 30:31.400
Son, for all these years,

30:31.480 --> 30:33.640
you have suffered in Jingbei.

30:33.720 --> 30:35.440
Now that you can stand, all is well.

30:35.520 --> 30:39.560
Back then, I thought
your leg couldn't be saved.

30:46.880 --> 30:47.960
The healer said,

30:48.480 --> 30:50.240
only by breaking and resetting the bone

30:50.800 --> 30:53.080
do you stand a chance to walk again.

31:23.360 --> 31:24.480
Heavens blessed you.

31:25.000 --> 31:26.920
You are truly fortunate.

31:32.360 --> 31:35.240
I never expected that Xiyan beauty

31:35.320 --> 31:38.960
had seduced me
just to try and assassinate me.

31:43.080 --> 31:47.040
Father, how would you handle her?

31:47.840 --> 31:48.880
Do not worry.

31:50.160 --> 31:52.480
I will see to it personally.

31:53.480 --> 31:55.240
First, recover well.

31:56.480 --> 31:59.920
Father, those Xiyan people hate me

32:00.440 --> 32:02.320
but would not dare
assassinate me so openly,

32:02.400 --> 32:03.760
jeopardizing the peace-making marriage.

32:04.600 --> 32:05.920
You mean to say?

32:06.560 --> 32:07.440
Within the court,

32:07.520 --> 32:11.200
someone wish to use them
to rid me for good.

32:14.000 --> 32:15.440
Who do you suspect?

32:23.120 --> 32:24.760
Of everyone in court,

32:25.280 --> 32:28.720
only you, Big Brother,
would never harm me.

32:34.520 --> 32:36.800
Father, I request

32:36.880 --> 32:38.760
that the Eastern Palace
lead the investigation.

32:47.320 --> 32:50.240
Son, this is related to Xiyan.

32:50.320 --> 32:52.160
Handle this with utmost caution.

32:58.240 --> 32:59.480
Rest assured, Third Brother.

32:59.560 --> 33:03.520
I'll uncover who's behind this.

33:06.600 --> 33:08.000
IMPERIAL PRISON

33:17.120 --> 33:18.280
Fear not, Your Highness.

33:18.360 --> 33:20.160
No one leaves here with secrets intact

33:20.240 --> 33:21.960
after facing these instruments of torture.

33:31.680 --> 33:32.680
Your Highness,

33:34.680 --> 33:37.040
Minister Zhang
has waited outside for long.

33:37.120 --> 33:39.120
He claims the woman has no ties to him.

33:39.720 --> 33:41.800
If this woman isn't Zhang Yin's agent,

33:41.880 --> 33:43.080
then she must be Third Brother's.

33:43.600 --> 33:44.760
Ten years on,

33:44.840 --> 33:46.920
Prince Jing still uses
this "feigned injury" ploy,

33:47.000 --> 33:49.440
proving he has no other evidence

33:49.520 --> 33:51.560
beyond Momai Warriors.

33:51.640 --> 33:53.880
The Qingzhou incident was flawless.

33:54.400 --> 33:57.320
Even with ten more years,

33:57.400 --> 33:59.480
Prince Jing wouldn't be able
to trace it back to Your Highness.

34:00.360 --> 34:01.760
Tell Zhang Yin to hold steady.

34:02.280 --> 34:03.480
Now, go and summon my third brother.

34:04.280 --> 34:05.320
Yes, Your Highness.

34:18.920 --> 34:20.080
You aren't the true culprit
of the massacre.

34:21.840 --> 34:23.800
I have proof. Save me.

34:29.520 --> 34:33.800
She even pierced the Gold Silk Armor
yet deliberately spared me.

34:34.320 --> 34:35.199
My lord.

34:41.159 --> 34:43.520
My lord. The medicine is cold now.

35:00.520 --> 35:03.520
Qingyan, could there be clues out there?

35:04.440 --> 35:06.040
Clues that we missed?

35:08.760 --> 35:12.520
Even if there are,
none would expose the Crown Prince.

35:13.400 --> 35:16.240
Years of effort only led to Zhang Yin.

35:16.760 --> 35:18.200
If not for Your Highness recognizing

35:18.280 --> 35:19.720
that Eastern Palace advisor among the mob,

35:20.240 --> 35:22.800
we'd never have suspected the Crown Prince

35:23.400 --> 35:25.800
was behind the Qingzhou arson.

35:28.840 --> 35:31.600
Now, Mei Lin's assassination attempt

35:32.120 --> 35:34.400
exposes the Momai on her.

35:34.480 --> 35:37.760
It'll eventually trace back
to Zhang Yin's Momai Warriors.

35:38.280 --> 35:41.640
All we need to do
is wait for Zhang Yin to make his move.

35:41.720 --> 35:43.360
If he silences Mei Lin,

35:43.440 --> 35:46.080
he'll bear the blame
for this assassination.

35:47.200 --> 35:49.080
Unable to shoulder such a charge,

35:49.160 --> 35:51.400
he'll turn to the Crown Prince.

35:51.480 --> 35:54.680
And the Crown Prince, to protect himself,

35:54.760 --> 35:55.920
will discard Zhang Yin.

35:57.760 --> 36:00.560
Zhang Yin then has but one option

36:00.640 --> 36:02.680
to accuse the Eastern Palace.

36:03.800 --> 36:05.240
Though his confession

36:05.320 --> 36:07.120
won't topple the Crown Prince,

36:07.200 --> 36:11.440
it will sow seeds of doubt
in our father's heart.

36:11.520 --> 36:12.760
Then we'll have grounds

36:12.840 --> 36:15.360
to investigate the Qingzhou affair openly.

36:17.360 --> 36:20.240
Someone reported
Zhang Yin waited hours outside prison

36:20.320 --> 36:21.440
but never saw the Crown Prince.

36:22.760 --> 36:24.560
Zhang Yin values profit over loyalty.

36:24.640 --> 36:27.720
A good dog when in favor,

36:27.800 --> 36:32.320
but a deadly one when betrayed.

36:32.840 --> 36:34.440
The Crown Prince won't see him.

36:34.520 --> 36:37.240
He'll surely silence Mei Lin himself.

36:38.960 --> 36:41.920
Your Highness, the Crown Prince
wants you to visit the prison.

36:45.320 --> 36:47.360
It seems Big Brother has guessed

36:47.440 --> 36:49.880
Mei Lin was a bait I laid.

36:51.880 --> 36:53.480
As ever, Your Highness,
your strategy is sound.

36:53.560 --> 36:57.080
The Shadow Works was founded
to gather truths of old

36:57.160 --> 36:59.760
and now executes the Momai plan.

36:59.840 --> 37:02.440
Only Mei Lin bears the Momai poison.

37:02.520 --> 37:03.640
Even under torture,

37:03.720 --> 37:05.560
it will be traced solely to Zhang Yin.

37:39.120 --> 37:40.360
Did she confess?

37:40.440 --> 37:42.560
No, she hasn't uttered a word.

37:43.440 --> 37:46.800
No rush. Once she's been
through everything,

37:46.880 --> 37:49.080
even her iron will shall break.

37:49.160 --> 37:51.360
With these tools of torture
at our disposal,

37:52.200 --> 37:55.480
any secrets she holds
will be revealed as we wish.

37:56.280 --> 37:58.840
Whether she speaks or what she says

37:59.720 --> 38:00.920
no longer matters.

38:07.280 --> 38:08.960
True enough.

38:09.040 --> 38:12.000
To withstand such torture,
she never said a thing.

38:12.080 --> 38:13.880
This shows something.

38:27.120 --> 38:28.360
You're right.

38:28.960 --> 38:30.800
She's no mere Xiyan beauty

38:31.440 --> 38:33.600
but a trained assassin.

38:34.560 --> 38:36.200
The mark on her arm

38:36.280 --> 38:38.000
tells of her fate
in the hands of Momai poison.

38:39.680 --> 38:42.520
How do you know this so clearly?

38:45.120 --> 38:47.200
It's not hard to obtain the poison.

38:47.720 --> 38:48.920
But as to who slipped it to her,

38:50.040 --> 38:52.280
only she holds the key to that mystery.

38:53.720 --> 38:55.320
Why haven't you spoken yet?

38:56.040 --> 38:57.160
Waiting for an antidote?

38:57.680 --> 38:58.960
Your master deceived you.

38:59.040 --> 39:00.400
There is no antidote.

39:02.320 --> 39:04.320
Who ordered you to attack Prince Jing?

39:05.280 --> 39:06.560
Speak.

39:13.480 --> 39:15.000
No one ordered me.

39:24.640 --> 39:25.720
Hold.

39:26.960 --> 39:28.480
Reveal what you know

39:29.160 --> 39:30.800
and I'll grant you a quick death.

39:30.880 --> 39:33.480
A quick death is mercy.

39:33.560 --> 39:35.120
But after all you've suffered,

39:35.200 --> 39:36.920
how could I show her mercy?

39:37.000 --> 39:38.480
If I granted her quick death,

39:38.560 --> 39:40.680
how would I account to Father?

39:43.480 --> 39:44.360
I…

39:45.640 --> 39:47.040
cannot die.

39:55.240 --> 39:57.040
An attempted assassination in the court

39:57.120 --> 39:58.920
will only lead to your execution.

39:59.680 --> 40:03.040
From the start, you were someone's pawn,

40:04.000 --> 40:05.480
dead the moment you failed.

40:05.560 --> 40:07.720
To imagine otherwise is folly.

40:09.280 --> 40:11.600
Brother, don't waste time on her.

40:12.480 --> 40:14.760
She won't reveal what you seek.

40:16.040 --> 40:17.680
She's merely a tool,

40:18.280 --> 40:21.680
who knows nothing of her master.

40:45.000 --> 40:46.600
PRINCE JING'S MANSION

40:46.680 --> 40:47.880
Minister Zhang,

40:47.960 --> 40:51.200
how was the show I arranged for you?

40:52.800 --> 40:53.920
Your Highness, I don't get it.

40:54.000 --> 40:55.280
Please enlighten me.

40:56.120 --> 40:57.520
In the 14th year of the Zhaoming era,

40:57.600 --> 40:59.760
when we first met,

40:59.840 --> 41:02.520
you were but
a minor border patrol officer.

41:03.040 --> 41:07.040
Now, a decade later,
you are the Minister of Defense,

41:11.560 --> 41:13.480
leaping six ranks in ten years.

41:14.200 --> 41:17.480
Tell me, what kind of lucky streak
have you been riding on?

41:19.120 --> 41:20.480
I am unworthy, Your Highness.

41:20.560 --> 41:23.720
It's all thanks to your heroic deeds
in recovering Qingzhou.

41:25.000 --> 41:27.080
When Qingzhou's battle began,

41:27.160 --> 41:29.600
you dismissed me for cowardice.

41:29.680 --> 41:32.120
But when Weibei Army suffered defeat,

41:33.120 --> 41:35.080
I survived and gained my fortune.

41:37.040 --> 41:39.360
Yet I, as their general, still live.

41:39.440 --> 41:42.400
Weibei Army won't bear this shame in vain.

41:44.680 --> 41:47.080
However lucky streak
you may have been riding on,

41:47.160 --> 41:49.880
if the tide turns,
you'll end up in hot water.

41:51.560 --> 41:53.600
As someone I hate,

41:54.360 --> 41:57.160
guess what will happen to you?

42:01.200 --> 42:04.680
Your Highness, I don't understand.
Please enlighten me.

42:11.360 --> 42:13.720
She's no mere beauty.

42:13.800 --> 42:16.600
She's a death warrior
with the Momai poison in her.

42:18.880 --> 42:20.840
Momai Warriors.

42:21.560 --> 42:24.560
I encountered them in Qingzhou.

42:27.960 --> 42:31.240
Your Highness,
I have no ties to this woman.

42:42.680 --> 42:45.480
The prison's methods are effective,

42:46.360 --> 42:48.160
but a prince's assassination,

42:48.240 --> 42:52.240
not even your master
could afford the consequences.

42:52.320 --> 42:54.200
If things go south for your benefactor,

42:54.280 --> 42:55.720
your fate is clear.

42:56.240 --> 42:58.880
Be silenced or be the scapegoat.

43:02.120 --> 43:03.480
You know I lost a whole bunch
of my best men.

43:03.560 --> 43:05.240
So, whether you survive or not

43:05.840 --> 43:07.520
depends on my mood.

45:01.880 --> 45:02.920
Un…

45:05.920 --> 45:06.960
dy…

45:09.680 --> 45:10.520
ing.

45:10.600 --> 45:11.800
Un…

45:12.680 --> 45:13.640
dy…

45:14.560 --> 45:15.800
ing.

45:16.320 --> 45:18.000
What did you say, my lord?

45:20.480 --> 45:21.760
Keep watching.

45:21.840 --> 45:24.120
Zhang Yin will soon silence her.

45:26.320 --> 45:27.880
I fear Mei Lin may not last.

45:28.480 --> 45:29.760
I've seen the prison's methods.

45:29.840 --> 45:30.720
Tendons pulled, skin peeled…

45:30.800 --> 45:32.160
She will endure.

45:34.480 --> 45:36.000
Years of training,

45:37.040 --> 45:38.640
all for this day.
